ld open-source such software.<p>No need to support evil giants, it's enough to host it elsewhere.</p></div></div></div>","author":"","comments":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50532613","siteTitle":"Hacker News","siteHash":"37bb545430005dba450c1e40307450d8e4e791b434e83f3d38915ebad510fd50","entryHash":"8a4f7a3c074bbc52d46e6221121b75f6fafe991f78e3f41198b55d7ac68315a9","category":"Tech"}